<title>CANADA: Saskatchewan Wheat Pool details crop yield, output.</title>
<headline>Saskatchewan Wheat Pool details crop yield, output.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saskatchewan Wheat Pool on Thursday detailed a preliminary yield and production estimate for its major crops based on conditions up to Sept 9.</p>
<p>CROP   HARVESTED ACRES ('000)  YIELD (BU/AC)  OUTPUT ('000 T)</p>
<p>	    1996   86/95 AVG     1996  86/95 AVG 1996  86/95 AVG</p>
<p>W.Wheat    110     189	   29.8    25	  89    129</p>
<p>S.Wheat 14,530  15,095	   30.8    28    12,180 11,503</p>
<p>Durum    4,300   4,027	   30.7    28     3,593  3,069</p>
<p>Oats     1,900     952	   62.3    54     1,826    793</p>
<p>Barley   4,600   3,533	   51.6    46     5,168  3,538</p>
<p>Rye	  210     280	   26.8    26	 143    185</p>
<p>Flax	 900     703	   20.2    18	 462    321</p>
<p>Canola   4,100   3,861	   22.8    22     2,120  1,926</p>
<p>TOTAL:  30,650  28,640			     25,581 21,464</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
